WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: On a computer with appearance permission, open the blue dropdown and choose App edit.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Configure or rearrange supported Home sections and their dimensions. Staff and Manager Home keep separate section layouts.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Step 3: Select supported surfaces for appearance changes. Select the Home greeting to change its wording while keeping {user} exactly once.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Step 4: Review saved changes, use Undo if needed and choose Finish editing.
